  "releaseNotes": "v2.7.0: IMPROVED Middleware - HTTP log fields now match Node.js SDK format for unified frontend display! Fields: http_method, http_url, http_path, http_status_code, http_duration_ms, http_query_string, http_remote_addr, http_user_agent, http_request_body, http_response_body. Status-based log levels: >=500=ERROR, >=400=WARN, others=INFO. Full compatibility with express-middleware.",
